version 3 or later.

The gems_microbiome example is adapted from msd16s 1.32.0 by Joseph N.
Paulson, Hector Corrada Bravo and Mihai Pop, distributed under the
Artistic License 2.0: https://doi.org/10.18129/B9.bioc.msd16s.
SACAT selects two age groups from the non-diarrheal controls, aggregates
counts by genus and retains the original sample library sizes.

The original study is Pop et al. (2014), Genome Biology 15:R76,
https://doi.org/10.1186/gb-2014-15-6-r76. The authors apply the CC0
dedication to data made available in the article unless otherwise stated:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/.
